      "issue": "Blank field implies no recorded boundary verification; this is an inference from a missing record. The claim upgrades the blank field into proof that no verification occurred.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "The completed WO-527-E after interruption or a contemporaneous log entry showing valve states and isolation checks performed by U-A/U-B before 10:00 AM.",
      "question": "Did U-A or U-B verbally confirm to RHOB operations that the receiving header was isolated, and is there any audio transcript or shift handover note capturing this confirmation?"
